{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D pixel art action and science fiction shoot'em up game, where you must block the bullets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you will control with the mouse a small and indestructible starfish tasked with defending the Ilumi, beings of energy that inhabit colorful capsules at the center of the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies will arrive in waves, and you must destroy them before they destroy the Ilumi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During battles, you will receive help from different companions, and throughout the campaign consisting of 20 levels, you will unlock new skills and powers that will help you in more advanced levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is intense. Can you stop the rain of bullets falling on the Ilumi?.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must be focused and concentrated to stop all the bullets and ensure the survival of the Ilumi.\u00a0As they cross the galaxy.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3792830?t=1751044601","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3792830?t=1751044601","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792830/190539b09e948d8098ce7281722bf16c58d521bd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751044601","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792830/190539b09e948d8098ce7281722bf16c58d521bd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751044601","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D pixel art action and science fiction shoot'em up game, where you must block the bullets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you will control with the mouse a small and indestructible starfish tasked with defending the Ilumi, beings of energy that inhabit colorful capsules at the center of the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies will arrive in waves, and you must destroy them before they destroy the Ilumi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During battles, you will receive help from different companions, and throughout the campaign consisting of 20 levels, you will unlock new skills and powers that will help you in more advanced levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is intense. Can you stop the rain of bullets falling on the Ilumi?.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must be focused and concentrated to stop all the bullets and ensure the survival of the Ilumi.\u00a0As they cross the galaxy.</p>","developers":["Carlos Perez Lagos"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792830/dae3260bc3319f38c59502735c280de4de4c987a/header.jpg?t=1751044601","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3792830/1320716141/8024c3bac971908404f04841ee23336b803c19e0/1750369341/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749680374","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3792830/1320716141/8024c3bac971908404f04841ee23336b803c19e0/1750369341/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749680374","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3792830/1320716141/8024c3bac971908404f04841ee23336b803c19e0/1750369341/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749680374","id":257149868,"name":"StellarFish","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257149868/eb3d393d13c5e6aff13f03694edf0b1b3d2fbab4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749680374"}],"name":"StellarFish","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Selec